message: "If you use this curriculum or its notebooks in your learning, teaching, or projects, please cite it as below."
title: "python-to-ai: A 54-Week Curriculum from Python Fundamentals to Modern AI Systems"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "python-to-ai contributors"
    alias: "idewithasmile"
repository-code: "https://github.com/idewithasmile/python-to-ai"
url: "https://idewithasmile.github.io/python-to-ai/"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  An open-source, project-driven 54-week curriculum spanning Python fundamentals,
  mathematics for machine learning, probability and statistics, classical machine learning,
  deep learning from first principles with NumPy and PyTorch, computer vision,
  natural language processing, generative AI, graph neural networks, and large language models.
